  "caveats": [
    "RCAEval faults are injected network delay/packet-loss (RCA scenarios), not adversarial DDoS; used for the latency-degradation SHAPE, paired with MicroservicesDDoS for attack semantics.",
    "MicroservicesDDoS gives container/resource saturation, not per-request latency; 5s sampling cadence cannot validate the sub-2s detection-latency claim.",
    "Alibaba is general production microservices (not payment, not under attack); used for RT baseline realism and graph-scale only; only a few time-windows scanned (row cap).",
    "Block rates are TIG-CDO design targets and are NOT measured; the SLA re-run swaps only the latency distribution to real values.",
